# state: returning   (classifier-path reopen using the kept golden profile; #433 step 6d)
# Battlefield 2: Modern Combat (45410062): a `returning` variant of
# bf2mc.route (first-run) for a disk that already has the kept profile/save.
# The profile gate refuses a repeat first-run creation (R1: the title already
# has a kept profile); this route opens with `drive generic` instead of the
# first-run's blind boot-to-create-campaign-to-name-entry sequence, replaying
# whatever title/menu screens a returning disk shows with the trained
# classifier until play is confirmed, then marks. Player control is
# unchanged from the first-run route: LY min walked forward, RX turned, RT
# fired.
drive generic 300 mark
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    axis LY mid
    axis RX max
    wait 0.6
    axis RX mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    axis LY mid
    axis RX min
    wait 0.6
    axis RX mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
}
